      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this beautifully renovated three double bedroom semi-detached home on Cooley Road, Dublin 12. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation is spacious throughout and comprises a fitted kitchen, three generously proportioned double bedrooms with original feature fireplaces, a newly renovated bathroom with a walk-in shower, feature tiling and brushed gold fixtures. There is also a living room which is currently used as a 4th bedroom, but has the option to be used as either. Outside, the property benefits from a large, sun-filled rear garden with decked seating area, as well as a driveway and on-street parking to the front.\r\n\r\nCooley Road is superbly located in Dublin 12, offering excellent accessibility to Dublin city centre and beyond. The area is well served by regular Dublin Bus routes into the city centre, with the Luas Red Line also within easy reach, making for a straightforward commute. Local amenities including shops, schools and parks are all close by, while the M50 is easily accessible for those travelling by car.\r\n\r\n1.Three double bedrooms\r\n2.Option of 4th bedroom or living room\r\n3.Recently renovated throughout\r\n4.Modern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\n5.Renovated bathroom with walk-in shower\r\n6.Large, sunlit rear garden with decking\r\n7.Driveway and on-street parking\r\n8.Excellent transport links to Dublin city centre\r\n9.Close to local shops, schools and parks\r\n10.Easy access to the M50\r\n\r\nENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY PLEASE."
      },
